---@field advancementMode launchdarkly.EnvironmentReleaseAdvancementMode
---@field createdAt number Creation time in Unix milliseconds.
---@field startedAt? number Start of the first phase in Unix milliseconds. Absent until a phase has started.
---@field endedAt? number End of the last started phase in Unix milliseconds. Present only after the release reaches a terminal status of `completed` or `reverted`.
