---One ordered phase of an environment release.
---@class launchdarkly.EnvironmentReleasePhase
---@field id string
---@field phaseIndex number Zero-based index of this phase.
---@field ruleId string|distilled.Null ID of the flag rule for this phase. New public-API releases always have a rule ID. `null` is retained only when reading a historical release that ran on the default rule.
---@field description? string The description of the flag rule when this release was created. Omitted for default-rule phases.
---@field status launchdarkly.ReleaseStatus
---@field statusReason? launchdarkly.ReleaseStatusReason
---@field steps launchdarkly.EnvironmentReleasePhaseStepsList
---@field currentStepIndex? number Zero-based index of the step the phase is on. Omitted until the first step starts. Once the phase completes or reverts, it stays at the last step that started, unlike `currentPhaseIndex`, which becomes `null` when the release reaches a terminal status.
---@field startedAt? number Start of the phase in Unix milliseconds.
---@field endedAt? number End of the phase in Unix milliseconds.
---@field metricStatuses launchdarkly.EnvironmentReleasePhaseMetricStatusesMap Per-phase metric status keyed by metric key. Empty for progressive releases. Metric definitions and monitoring preferences live once in the parent release's `metrics` array.

