---@field classifiers? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestClassifiersList Replaces classifier rules on a judge variation. An empty array clears them. When this array is non-empty, messages must be empty.
---@field comment? string Human-readable description of what this patch changes
---@field description? string Description for agent when the config is in agent mode.
---@field instructions? string Instructions for agent when the config is in agent mode.
---@field messages? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestMessagesList The prompt messages for this variation
---@field model? any Freeform JSON object. LaunchDarkly does not validate the keys. In a model config, `params` and `customParams` hold parameters that the provider's API accepts, for example `{"temperature": 0.7, "maxTokens": 4096}`.
---@field modelConfigKey? string The key that GET /api/v2/projects/{projectKey}/ai-configs/model-configs returns for the model config. Do not use a custom model config's ID, which is the provider model ID.
---@field modelConfigVersion? number The exact model config version to set this variation to. Requires modelConfigKey to be set (either in this patch or already on the variation), and the version must exist for that model config. When omitted, the variation keeps the version it is currently set to, unless the patch changes modelConfigKey, in which case the variation records the new model config's current (latest) version.
---@field name? string A human-readable name for the variation
---@field outputFormat? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestOutputFormatMap JSON Schema defining the structured output format for the variation.
---@field published? boolean Whether to publish this version of the variation
---@field state? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestState|string The state to move the variation to. Omit this field to keep the current state. - `archived`: Archive a published variation. You cannot archive a variation that is already archived. You also cannot archive the only variation of an AI Config. An AI Config itself cannot be archived. - `published`: Restore an archived variation. You cannot publish a variation that is already published.
---@field tools? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestToolsList List of tools to use for this variation. The latest version of the tool will be used.
---@field toolKeys? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestToolKeysList List of tool keys to use for this variation. The latest version of the tool will be used.
---@field skills? launchdarkly.PatchAIConfigVariationRequestSkillsList List of agent skills to attach to this variation. Replaces the current attachments.
---@field judgeConfiguration? launchdarkly.JudgeConfiguration

