---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input launchdarkly.CreateApprovalRequestApplyRequest
---@return launchdarkly.ApprovalRequestResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_approval_request_apply(input) end

